<title>UK: TABLE-Electra adjusted NAV up to 567.74p.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Electra adjusted NAV up to 567.74p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    4.5	  vs  3.9</p>
<p> Net asset value (pence) 569.74	 vs  474.74*</p>
<p>Total return on</p>
<p>   shareholders funds     90.1	  vs  up 10.17 percent</p>
<p> Shareholders funds	969	    vs  886</p>
<p>NOTE - *Adjusted NAV up 9.12 percent from 522.13 pence on September 30, 1996. This compares with an increase of 7.95 percent in the FTSE All-Share Index in the same period. Its NAV in the six months to March 31, 1996 was 474.74 pence. Both total return and shareholders funds figures compare with September 30.</p>
<p>Full company name - Electra Investment Trust Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
